That's a good point.

We can't _really_ tell fom their login times, though, since there's no way to
distinguish between a session ending because they saved and a session ending
because the game ended.  At least, there isn't from outside the game.

This would probably be dealt with best by adding a new counter to the game that
starts at 0 and adds the number of seconds of each session to the counter
whenever the game is saved or checkpointed.

